  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.8 / stable ABI 8 repair test build. Xayah and Yone encyclopedia cards now use the stock 0.5.8 ChampionInfoUIRunner exactly like the installed finished champion mods: their data_champion sprite, idle frame and champion_view camera remain the only image route. The compiled runtime no longer rebinds, resizes or hides the native icon, and no custom champion_slot/overlay enters the runtime package, removing the blank-card failure path. Battle, BP and compact portrait cameras are unchanged. Yone's native eight-frame run keeps all eight authored upper-body and dual-sword poses; four complete grounded authored lower-body phases drive the first half-cycle and their whole-patch horizontal mirrors drive the second, producing right-contact x4 then left-contact x4 without drawn legs, resize, shear or duplicated pixels. There is no frame blend, synthetic sword redraw or alpha afterimage; the canonical frames face screen-right and rely only on the game's native flip_x when movement changes side. Fate Sealed keeps its staged wind-up, launch, knock-up, dual-slash and pull/echo presentation aligned to the real rush tick. His pure-data Q/W/R kit has no active E; retired native names remain no-op saved-season compatibility shims. Shen stays on the repaired original Q/W/R contract. All nine data_champion definitions, BP chrome and illustrations, Rift map/towers/Nexus, HUD art, announcer audio and BP/match music remain active. A fresh test save is required only for the previously introduced current Yone action tree.",
